--- a/docs/user/FlowVariables.md
+++ b/docs/user/FlowVariables.md
@@ -249,6 +249,7 @@
 | <a name="RECOVER_POWER"></a>RECOVER_POWER| Specifies how many percent of paths with positive slacks can be slowed for power savings [0-100].| 0|
